      "title": "1. Introduction",
      "level": 2,
      "line_start": 3,
      "text_length": 166,
      "text_preview": "The `Fw::Com` port is used to pass binary data to a service for transporting data out of the system. \nIncoming and outgoing packets are serialized into these buffers."
    },
