      "number": "2.1.2.1",
      "title": "2.1.2.1 Fw::ComPacket",
      "level": 5,
      "line_start": 20,
      "text_length": 120,
      "text_preview": "The `Fw::ComPacket` class is a base class for other packet classes. It provides type identification for packet subtypes."
    },
    {
      "number": "2.1.2.2",
      "title": "2.1.2.2 Fw::ComBuffer",
      "level": 5,
      "line_start": 24,
      "text_length": 159,
      "text_preview": "The `Fw::ComBuffer` class represents a buffer to store data for transmission. It is used as a destination buffer for serialization of `Fw::ComPacket` subtypes."
    },
